	'ka643abca' => 'm²',
	'ka6ba8bb8' => 'The PM2.5 light ring indicator',
	'ka848e784' => 'Ships March 2027',
	'ka854b2e0' => 'At 19 dB, Night mode was engineered to operate beneath the ambient noise of a quiet bedroom. Priya Raman tuned the acoustic resonance of the fan blades and motor housing in our Rotterdam test room so the unit produces only a gentle, steady murmur. A discreet PM2.5 light ring emits a soft white glow, ensuring uninterrupted sleep while air circulates continuously through the night.',
	'ka9bb9346' => 'Three movements, no tools.',
	'kaad4e3a9' => 'What size room is Mado Air designed for?',
	'kaba61c1e' => 'The four-step reservation process',
	'kaf923176' => '27 dB · 8 W',
	'kb029ad42' => 'Reserve yours today.',
	'kb06e77f0' => 'Before opening pre-orders, we placed prototype units in four real homes across Europe and North America. Test-room coordinator Hana Sato-Lindgren followed each household over months to learn how Mado Air lives in everyday spaces.',
	'kb1097b9d' => 'Mado Air',
	'kb10f0c75' => 'Warranty',
	'kb36d2184' => 'Specifications',
	'kb38c9a5f' => 'Named after the Japanese word for window, Mado Air was conceived from the realization that air purifiers usually sit awkwardly on the floor like discarded office equipment. Measuring 22 × 22 × 38 cm, its compact square footprint with softly rounded vertical edges fits neatly on standard sills and low shelves. Co-founder and industrial design lead Ines Albrecht focused on proportions that complement architectural window reveals, allowing natural morning daylight to graze the matte chalk-white exterior while keeping indoor air circulating cleanly through your home.',
	'kb404ad35' => 'The 60-day home trial programme',
	'kb422d0c7' => 'Inside the design',
	'kb483475a' => 'DIMENSIONS',
	'kb6f87908' => 'Filters &amp; care',
	'kb770709b' => 'PM2.5, shown by the light ring',
	'kb78ce3ed' => 'Reserve (no charge) → Confirm colour by e-mail in February 2027 → Ships March 2027 → 60-day home trial.',
	'kb7f9b888' => 'Pre-order pricing and options',
	'kb9deaa30' => 'AIRFLOW',
	'kb9e4f876' => 'Reserve yours. Pay when it ships.',
	'kba0ada21' => 'Jonah Whitfield',
	'kba16b5e0' => 'What finishes are available?',
	'kba5b6b3b' => 'Night, Calm, Auto, Boost',
	'kba5ec1ce' => 'SHIPPING',
	'kba6ebe03' => 'Questions, answered.',
	'kbcff8b90' => '3–28 W',
	'kc099a0c7' => 'PRE-ORDER',
	'kc0ef908a' => 'Our studio',
	'kc23e4fc5' => 'Box contents and warranty coverage',
	'kc26a165e' => 'Support hours: Mon–Fri 9:00–17:00 CET · hello@mado-air.example',
	'kc2a0b84b' => 'FILTER CHANGE',
	'kc3cc8390' => '22 × 22 × 38 cm, 2.6 kg.',
	'kc414e8d4' => 'Your contact details are used exclusively to communicate project updates, deliver your colour confirmation invitation in February 2027, and coordinate the delivery of your Mado Air purifier. We never sell, rent, or distribute your personal information to third-party marketing brokers. If you ever wish to review, update, or permanently delete your contact data from our system, please contact customer support lead Kwame Mensah at hello@mado-air.example during our office hours of Mon–Fri 9:00–17:00 CET.',
	'kc4a263f2' => 'Mado Air is available in Chalk (matte chalk-white body with light warm-grey fabric) and Graphite (charcoal body with dark grey fabric).',
	'kc57e377c' => 'Product lead, pre-order and launch',
	'kc5be1d13' => '$34 / 6 months',
	'kc5f29bb3' => 'Privacy',
	'kc79e112d' => 'You can reach our dedicated support team directly by emailing hello@mado-air.example. Our team is based in Rotterdam and available Monday through Friday from 9:00 to 17:00 Central European Time (CET). Led by customer support lead Kwame Mensah, we handle every question personally, whether you need assistance updating your pre-order details, tracking delivery windows, or asking questions about room placement and filter care.',
	'kc79ecc58' => 'Every airflow path, motor mount, and acoustic baffle is evaluated in our purpose-built test room in Rotterdam. Rather than relying on theoretical simulations or inflated laboratory ratings, airflow engineer Tomás Reyes measures sound levels at exactly 1 m and calculates clean air delivery up to 160 m³/h under authentic domestic conditions. We never make speculative medical assertions; we design quiet machines that reliably refresh rooms up to 22 m² through careful, honest engineering.',
	'kc8313c19' => 'Every swatch, grille and dial starts life on this bench in Rotterdam before it reaches your windowsill.',
	'kc8589f6d' => 'Quieter than the room itself.',
	'kc86dbc8a' => 'Chalk &nbsp; <span class="ma-sw ma-sw--graphite"></span> Graphite',
	'kca0795c4' => 'Customer support at Mado Home Studio is led directly from our Rotterdam headquarters by Kwame Mensah. Below you will find answers to frequently asked questions about operating, maintaining, and reserving Mado Air.',
	'kcaef9deb' => 'These terms govern all reservations, pre-orders, and purchases made through Mado Home Studio for the Mado Air compact purifier. By submitting a reservation, you agree to these fair and clear terms.',
	'kcc962bcc' => 'H13-grade pleated medium + activated carbon layer, change every 6 months',
	'kcd5bdd11' => 'TERMS',
	'kce3d4777' => 'An ambient light ring discreetly signals real-time air quality beneath the top dial without intrusive numeric displays or bright screens. Under normal, clean indoor conditions, the ring emits a soft white glow that blends naturally into ambient daylight or evening lighting. When elevated airborne particles are detected by the internal sensor, the ring transitions to a pale cyan tone. The indicator confirms active air purification calmly and unobtrusively, returning to soft white as particulate levels settle back to baseline in our Rotterdam test room testing.',
	'kcef2f099' => 'With two young children, we carry the unit between the nursery at naptime and our living room using the leather loop. It blends right into our shelves and feels like solid furniture.',
	'kd15dad07' => 'Filter subscription and recycling programme',
	'kd37d8955' => 'Colour preference',
	'kd5a3055a' => 'The word mado means window in Japanese. We began in 2021 with a simple question: why do air purifiers look like disposable white office plastic that people hide away behind sofas? Our design studio and test room in Rotterdam set out to create a compact object that belongs on a deep windowsill, where morning light enters and rooms naturally breathe. By pairing woven furniture textiles with precision aluminium, we created a quiet companion that enriches a room rather than cluttering it.',
	'kd5b906e1' => 'All initial production units are scheduled to ship in March 2027. In February 2027, you will receive an e-mail asking you to confirm your final colour choice of Chalk or Graphite and verify your shipping address. Your payment method will not be charged a single dollar until the package is packed and dispatched from our distribution facility. You are free to cancel your reservation at any point prior to shipping.',
	'kd6abb1c7' => 'studio apartment, Lisbon',
	'kd7778d0c' => 'Filter',
	'kd79bea14' => 'When and how to replace the filter',
	'kd7b2c0a1' => 'Our waitlist requires no upfront deposit or credit card commitment. You simply share your name, e-mail address, shipping country, and preliminary colour preference. We do not charge anything until your purifier is assembled, tested, and packed for shipment in March 2027. If your plans change, you can update your shipping details or cancel your reservation with a single click at any time, backed by our 60-day home trial and three-year warranty upon arrival.',
	'kd8912266' => 'Four modes at a glance',
	'kdb223fbd' => 'See the full specs',
	'kdb6ff082' => 'Mado Air was designed to restore that lost circulation gently. Sitting on a deep sill or shelf, it quietly draws air through its woven lower fabric and releases clean, continuous airflow back into the space.',
	'kdd4fe0cc' => 'Power',
	'kde08ef55' => 'Pre-order',
	'kde1fcc7f' => '1.8 m, USB-C service port only',
	'kdf001dcc' => 'FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS',
	'ke0e84826' => 'Joining the early access list reserves your place in our inaugural production run shipping in March 2027. Early access members lock in our promotional pre-order price of $289 instead of the standard $329 retail price. In February 2027, you will receive an advance notification from product lead Jonah Whitfield allowing you to confirm your preferred Chalk or Graphite colour before units are allocated to general pre-orders, alongside exclusive production behind-the-scenes notes from our Rotterdam test room.',
	'ke16336e3' => 'Priya Raman',
	'ke1c4bc95' => '19 dB',
	'ke2811f13' => '19 dB (Night) to 46 dB (Boost), measured at 1 m',
	'ke298eccf' => 'Full specifications →',
	'ke4045598' => 'Terms of service',
	'ke46f6edd' => '$0 until shipping · 60-day home trial',
	'ke5563881' => 'Every Mado Air purifier includes a 3-year warranty covering all mechanical components, fan motors, sensor assemblies, and manufacturing defects from the date of delivery. If your unit develops a functional fault during normal residential use, customer support lead Kwame Mensah and our team will arrange complimentary repair or replacement with pre-paid return logistics. Consumable items such as replacement filter cartridges are excluded from warranty coverage.',
