	'kfd278915' => 'Join the waitlist',
	'kfda4a30e' => 'Modes and sensor',
	'kfdddad70' => 'During this initial launch period, Mado Air in Chalk is available for pre-order at $289, reduced from the regular $329 retail price. Mado Air in Graphite is also offered at $289, reduced from $329. For multi-room homes, the Two-room set includes any two colours for $549. We also offer an Oak wall shelf for windowsill-less rooms for $29, individual replacement filters for $39, and our filter plan at $34 every 6 months with cancel-anytime flexibility. All prices are listed in USD across all regions.',
